<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL -Intel shares climb.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL -Intel shares climb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traders said on Wednesday shares in Intel Corp rose slightly after hours, to return to the 52-week high they reached earlier in the day.</p>
<p>Intel shares were up 1/8 at 85-1/8 after the market closed, traders said. During the day, the company's stock rose 11/16 to close at 85 in the wake of a firm book-to-bill ratio.</p>
<p>Otherwise, traders said after-hours activity was quiet.</p>
</text>
